  "details": "Title says it all. Previously, animating `grabFilter.allowSelf` and friends on physbones (with the setting pre-set to \"Other\") changed bone behavior appropriately. This no longer happens on open beta. I can confirm that collision filter is also broken, and people on live have it working correctly. Seems to happen on multiple avatars by different authors too.\n\nSimilar older issue: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/physbones-regression-allow-grabbing-no-longer-updates-via-animator\n\n(I'm technically on steam audio beta, if that matters)",
